# Build context of docker/nginx/Dockerfile (repository root): deny everything, then
# admit the nginx configuration, and the fonts and icon of the maintenance page
# (docker/nginx/maintenance). BuildKit prefers this file to the root .dockerignore.
*

!docker/nginx/
!src/LoDb.Web/public/fonts/
!src/LoDb.Web/public/favicon/favicon-96x96.png
